| Change | Vulnerability addressed |
|--------|--------------------------|
| `helmet()` | Adds CSP, HSTS, X‑Frame‑Options, etc. |
| `cors({origin: …})` | Restricts cross‑origin requests (prevents CSRF/Open redirects). |
| `express-rate-limit` | Thwarts brute‑force and DoS attacks. |
| JWT auth middleware (`authMiddleware`) | Enforces **A2 – Broken Authentication** for privileged routes. |
| Separate public `/users` (no email) vs. protected `/admin/users` | Limits data exposure (A3). |
| `express-validator` (`body(...)`) | Guarantees input type/format, preventing injection (A1, A03). |
| Central error handler | Hides stack traces, logs errors (A10). |
| `process.env.JWT_SECRET` + `NODE_ENV=production` | Encourages secret management and production hardening. |
| Exported app & conditional `listen` | Enables unit testing and avoids double‑listen in test runners. |

